[routes]

[commands]

[pages]
/telling                      the telling page
main[data-telling-state]      "refused" on a device that has refused
#ask                          still present, still pressable
#why                          why it is not on — "this device has refused",
                              or what the browser answered when pressed anyway
#endpoint                     absent while not on

[files]

[notes]
the page never decides the refusal itself: it reads the browser's own
answer, so the refused state is reachable only by driving a browser
that refuses
